        "subject": "privacy policy 1.1: the deletion paragraph says email-assisted deletion at launch",
        "body": "privacy policy 1.1: the deletion paragraph says email-assisted deletion at launch\n\nOwner, 2026-11-05: the privacy policy said deletion \"is confirmed with a\ncode sent to your verified WhatsApp number\", which is not yet true while\ncode delivery is unavailable. The owner's wording, EN/FR/AR, replaces that\nparagraph: the in-app flow and, when available, the WhatsApp code; else\nsupport@ verifies identity and authority, processes the request under the\naccount-deletion policy and confirms completion. Version 1.1, effective\n2026-11-04 (the build's VITE_LEGAL_EFFECTIVE_DATE).\n\nTests: privacy and account deletion are 1.1, the other four texts 1.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n",
